1
00:00:00,953 --> 00:00:02,283
I am not gonna fold.

2
00:00:02,455 --> 00:00:06,585
(Raj:)Well, excuse me. I don't think
Penny's out of line. You don't own her.

3
00:00:06,751 --> 00:00:08,421
It's like my girl Beyoncé says:

4
00:00:08,586 --> 00:00:11,376
"If you like it,
you should've put a ring on it."

5
00:00:12,715 --> 00:00:15,925
(Howard:)At the very least, when she found out
Leonard was upset about it...

6
00:00:16,093 --> 00:00:18,803
(Howard:)-...she should've backed off.
-Like when a guy's upset...

7
00:00:18,971 --> 00:00:21,601
...his friend agreed to take a class
with him and then doesn't...

8
00:00:21,766 --> 00:00:24,606
(Raj:)...because he's doing a juice fast
with his mother?

9
00:00:25,061 --> 00:00:27,101
(Howard:)I didn't know you were upset
about that.

10
00:00:27,271 --> 00:00:31,321
Really? Did you miss the subtle indicators?
Like me saying, "Howard, I am upset."

11
00:00:31,484 --> 00:00:34,024
HOWARD: Okay, sorry.
-Maybe it's different in this country.

12
00:00:34,195 --> 00:00:37,075
(Raj:)Back in India, it means you're upset
with a guy named Howard.

13
00:00:37,240 --> 00:00:39,950
(Howard:)-I said I'm sorry.
-Sorry doesn't make up for the fact...

14
00:00:40,117 --> 00:00:42,577
(Raj:)...I had to make chicken and rice
with this vegan guy.

15
00:00:42,745 --> 00:00:46,625
(Leonard:)Do you know
what vegan chicken and rice is? Rice.

16
00:00:46,791 --> 00:00:50,171
You think I was having fun? Sitting
around listening to my mother say:

17
00:00:50,336 --> 00:00:52,756
[AS MRS. WOLOWITZ] "Have you ever
peed so much in your life?"

18
00:00:52,922 --> 00:00:56,552
(Raj:)Oh, my God.
You are such a mama's boy.

19
00:00:56,717 --> 00:01:00,467
HOWARD: Don't bring my mother into this!
-You brought your mother into this!

